# Sole GitHub contributor

Repo owner/author is **Hasanwlip** only. Cursor / the agent must never appear as a contributor.

## When committing or pushing

- Author and committer must be Hasanwlip (e.g. `Hasanwlip <hasanwlip@users.noreply.github.com>` via `GIT_AUTHOR_*` / `GIT_COMMITTER_*` env — do not change git config).
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`, or any similar trailer.
- If a commit tool auto-appends a Cursor co-author line, amend/rewrite immediately and remove it before push (or force-with-lease if already pushed and the user wants it gone).
- Do not create commits under Cursor Agent / `cursoragent@cursor.com` identity.

## Releases / tags

- Tags and releases must point only at commits that have no Cursor co-author metadata.
